<title>USA: Pentech says legal judgment entered vs co.</title>
<headline>Pentech says legal judgment entered vs co.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pentech International Inc said Friday that a legal judgment of about $4 million was entered against it as a result of a previously announced adverse legal opinion dated July 30, 1996.</p>
<p>In a release issued Friday, the company said enforcement of this judgment, including legal fees as determined by the U.S. District Court for the Southern District of New York, has been stayed.</p>
<p>Pentech said it was pursuing an appeal, obtaining a bond and exploring an out-of-court settlement possibility.</p>
</text>
